KLineChart v10.0.3 — https://github.com/klinecharts/KLineChart
Copyright (c) 2019 lihu. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

  - crates/aeris_charts_indicators/src/klinechart/: the 27 built-in indicator formulas
    (src/extension/indicator), translated from TypeScript to Rust; outputs are returned as
    columns instead of per-row objects. Each module names the file it was translated from.
  - crates/aeris_charts_indicators/tests/ (klinechart_*.rs and their fixtures) and
    tools/klinechart_parity: parity fixtures generated by running KLineChart's own indicator
    code.
  - crates/aeris_charts_engine/src/klinechart_indicators.rs: KLineChart's default indicator
    styles (line palette, bar and dot colors).
  - crates/aeris_charts_engine/src/drawings/kinds/lines.rs (horizontal_segment, vertical_ray,
    vertical_segment, price_line), channels.rs (price_channel), and projection_annotations.rs
    (simple_tag, simple_annotation): the geometry, anchor rules, and look of the corresponding
    overlays (src/extension/overlay), reimplemented on the Aeris drawing model.

